@startuml
title Project — состав проекта и расчётной задачи
top to bottom direction
scale max 1500 width
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 16
skinparam ranksep 20
hide empty members

interface IProjectData
interface IGeneralData
interface ITaskData
interface IModelData <<Model>>
interface ICondData
class ProjectData
class GeneralData
class TaskData
class "ModelData" as ModelData <<Model>>
abstract class CondData
class GeneralParameters
class PhysicalSet

IProjectData <|.. ProjectData
IGeneralData <|.. GeneralData
ITaskData <|.. TaskData
ICondData <|.. CondData
IModelData <|.. ModelData
ProjectData *-- GeneralData
ProjectData *-- TaskData
ProjectData *-- ModelData
TaskData o-- CondData : условия
GeneralParameters o-- PhysicalSet : физические поля

note right of TaskData
  Условия и материалы:
  Project-1.mdpuml
end note
note right of GeneralParameters
  Параметры и физические поля:
  Project-2.mdpuml
end note
note right of ProjectData
  Функции и ввод/вывод:
  Project-3.mdpuml
end note
@enduml
